    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-39efe20e59422874",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 227,
      "excerpt": "昭儀、〔昭容昭儀　北監本、汲本、殿本「昭儀」在「昭容」上。按《南史·后妃傳》序，梁武帝所制九嬪之序，「昭儀」在「昭容」上，陳制多襲梁，當以作「昭儀、昭容」為是。〕脩華、脩儀、脩容九人，以擬古之九嬪。又置婕妤、容華、充華、承徽、烈榮五人，謂之五職，",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷7",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B77",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2015446",
      "textSha256": "81632806aeb190e3535565aaa816b97d52b9163d619b945d3a4aa4ee2bd22338",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-6e96b1cff83f8e43",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 289,
      "excerpt": "六七，红嵭憚役潰散，禁之不可，乃引其餘兵退還。蕭諮啟子雄及冏與賊交通，逗留不進，梁武帝队於廣州賜死。子雄弟子略、子烈嵭雄豪任俠，家屬在南江。天合謀於红曰：「盧公累代待遇我等亦甚厚矣，今見枉而死，不能為報，非丈夫也。我弟僧明萬人之敵，若圍州城，召百",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷8",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B78",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1750028",
      "textSha256": "851083259ae11b47658d2b697dde2ca89800b94d31507c1787ae78f7e43bbd38",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-a7ec4d02c037a0b6",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 5,
      "offset": 92,
      "excerpt": "\n\n　　王沖字長深，琅邪臨沂人也。祖僧衍，齊侍中。父茂璋，梁給事黃門侍郎。沖母，梁武帝妹新安穆公主，卒於齊世，武帝以沖偏孤，深所鍾愛。年十八，起家梁祕書郎。尋為永嘉太守。入為太子舍人，以父憂去職。服闋，除太尉臨川王府外兵參軍、東宮領直。累遷太子洗",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷17",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B717",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1544244",
      "textSha256": "98794b6eaf17385a98b2bab68c984556f2bfde558ac7e0dbc6b60eb835dc3b5f",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-1b5b9fa1da7f6f65",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 134,
      "excerpt": "事黃門侍郎。\n\n　　眾好學，頗有文詞，起家梁鎮衛南平王法曹參軍、太子舍人。是時，梁武帝制千字詩，眾為之注解。與陳郡謝景同時召見于文德殿，帝令眾為竹賦，賦成，奏，帝善之，手敕答曰：〔賦成奏帝善之手敕答曰　按北監本、汲本、殿本及《南史沈約傳》附眾傳並",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷18",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B718",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2132778",
      "textSha256": "3eb2d7e1226497b25309aa95dc774052150403d953e29610e6dc6ed8f63bf766",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-784c4fcff84f293b",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 2001,
      "excerpt": "，美風儀，博覽墳籍，善屬文。釋褐梁西中郎行參軍，尋署法曹外兵參軍，兼丹陽詔獄正。梁武帝於城西置士林館，荔乃製碑，奏上，帝命勒之于館，仍用荔為士林學士。尋為司文郎，遷通直散騎侍郎，兼中書舍人。時左右之任，多參權軸，內外機務，互有帶掌，唯荔與顧協淡然",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷19",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B719",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2132781",
      "textSha256": "0e3eec87c5d71c0920388c6d09bbbcc651506706be3a568eb229fca8d278aaa9",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-086ad24bb5af30fb",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 2593,
      "excerpt": "並以清白稱。\n\n王固\n\n　　王固字子堅，左光祿大夫通之弟也。少清正，頗涉文史，以梁武帝甥封莫口亭侯。舉秀才。起家梁祕書郎，遷太子洗馬，掌東宮管記，丁所生母憂去職。服闋，除丹陽尹丞。侯景之亂，奔于荊州，梁元帝承制以為相國戶曹屬，掌管記。尋聘于西魏，",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷21",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B721",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511909",
      "textSha256": "45c948e16a0dce43a5512dd002c6d6869712c31b0c3776825bd014a9a1996573",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-421acfdc60faa277",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 3,
      "offset": 965,
      "excerpt": "類也。\n\n　　累遷國子博士。時於城西立士林館，弘正居以講授，聽者傾朝野焉。弘正啟梁武帝周易疑義五十條，又請釋乾坤二繫曰：「臣聞易稱立象以盡意，繫辭以盡言，然後知聖人之情，幾可見矣。自非含微體極，盡化窮神，豈能通志成務，探賾致遠。而宣尼比之桎梏，絕",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷24",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B724",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1494985",
      "textSha256": "497fbc7eaf7e00281571d1a7471d93dc499bce3abe2ddb4523b4ceaa04e5f1aa",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-c311db13f208a941",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 143,
      "excerpt": "相聚寇抄，詔以之平為假節、超武將軍、都督衡州五郡征討諸軍事。及之平至，即皆平殄，梁武帝甚嘉賞之。元帝承聖中，累遷散騎常侍、右衛將軍、晉陵太守。世祖即位，除光祿大夫，慈訓宮衛尉，並不就，乃築山穿池，植以卉木，居處其中，有終焉之志。天康元年〔紀年對照",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷25",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B725",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2063242",
      "textSha256": "1832bf7f6f86b49206cdd17a4490b40ba564787022a6f12efd77af558925f016",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-806b16be18a2ee59",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 4312,
      "excerpt": "屈，未喻高懷。若問梁朝朱領軍异亦為卿相，此不踰其本分邪？此是天子所拔，非關選序。梁武帝云『世間人言有目色，我特不目色范悌』。宋文帝亦云『人世豈無運命，每有好官缺，輒憶羊玄保。』此則清階顯職，不由選也。秦有車府令趙高直至丞相，漢有高廟令田千秋亦為丞",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷26",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B726",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2132678",
      "textSha256": "98c59b5e8648ac0bad8e33c3c44065512985ed6b140a0ca0aca5d9c903f272c1",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-2627fb956e96bb72",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 3,
      "offset": 275,
      "excerpt": "中權將軍、丹陽尹何敬容開府，置佐史，並以貴冑充之，仍除敬容府主簿。遷尚書殿中郎。梁武帝撰正言始畢，製述懷詩，總預同此作，帝覽總詩，深降嗟賞。仍轉侍郎。尚書僕射范陽張纘，度支尚書琅邪王筠，都官尚書南陽劉之遴，並高才碩學，總時年少有名，纘等雅相推重，",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷27",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B727",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1463644",
      "textSha256": "4bdca440cfd7cee5943a90ad9f4905e535818686b5a01642760fbbd3556ab024",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-a855ec94614bf87a",
      "query": "梁武帝",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 4393,
      "excerpt": "到洽之子，見梁書到洽傳，未嘗為吏部。梁書到溉傳云溉以建安內史遷中書郎兼吏部。又云梁武帝每與對棋，從夕達旦。是「到仲舉」明為「到溉」之訛。\n\n〔二〕　即於坐所呼與為對　「為對」北監本、汲本、殿本作「對弈」。\n\n〔三〕　封文（始）〔招〕縣伯　據百衲本",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷29",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B729",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511159",
